WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.680
Mr. Shinobu's divorce is official.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.970
Look, big headlines, and a picture!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.820
Here, you can have this... take a look at it later.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.230
Misaki-san!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.700
Anyway it's the end, for you.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.920
But knowing you, you might choose your father.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:18.440
It's a difficult decision: take the money, or dump your mother...

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.230
Mariko-san!

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:43.080
Murderer!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.420
Murderer!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.920
Mariko-san!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:57.410
<b>28. The Christmas Candles</b>

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.450
Hello, Shinobu residence...

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.160
What? Mariko did what?!!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.120
How badly was Misaki-san hurt?

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.430
We sent her to the hospital.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:23.320
We are fortunate that only her arm was injured,

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.800
...and with treatment it should not be serious.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.080
But, it's the first such incident in the school's history,

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:31.830
...and we are very deeply concerned.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:34.580
I'm terribly, terribly sorry.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.810
I'll get there right away!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.580
What? Mariko is not at the school?

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.730
She left the classroom after the incident...

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.520
Are you sure that she's not home yet?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.470
I suppose I shouldn't ask... but what happened?

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.110
Blood spurted up to the ceiling!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.330
They say she always carries a knife in her bag.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.080
Her father had 3 lovers.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.150
The classroom was an ocean of blood!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.280
<i>My dear Brother...</i>

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.650
<i>The school was in an uproar over Mariko-san's incident.</i>

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.450
I heard that girl is a Sorority member!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.060
What! You're kidding!

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.880
I'm going to call her...

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.890
I'll... go with you.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.460
No one's home?

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:54.610
She may not have gotten home yet.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.300
Where can Mariko have gone?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.000
What can we do?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.900
Misonoo-san?

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.640
Obasama!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:10.530
The vice-principal called, and I was just now speaking to him.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:13.360
Misonoo-san...

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.570
Yes?

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.890
Do you know why Mariko would do such a thing to that other girl?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.890
Well, uhhh...

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.570
I...

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.460
Oh, I see. I thought so.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.000
Our family situation...

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:38.170
I'm sorry that it caused you problems too...

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.640
But...

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.480
But... what did the vice-principal say?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.700
She's suspended until the school board decides what to do.

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:55.510
Suspended? I see...

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:59.070
If it's OK... we'll stop by after school.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:02.880
Thank you. I'm going to the hospital now to see Misaki-san,

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.630
...and then I'll be going home.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.690
If I see Mariko-san, I'll call you.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.700
Thank you, Misonoo-san.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.680
Takada Hospital, in Kyozaki City, please.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.490
<i>My dear Brother,</i>

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.380
<i>...in the afternoon Misaki-san returned from the hospital.</i>

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:43.210
<i>But I felt a sense of relief.</i>

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:47.690
<i>It was obvious that her injury wasn't that serious.</i>

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.060
She's not back yet?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:03.540
I see.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:08.830
We'll check several places for her and then stop at your place later.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.650
Thanks, bye.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:14.470
Where shall we start?

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.410
Around the station I guess.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.490
OK! Let's hurry!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:41.910
Hey, ease up! It's right in front of me now and I'm working on it.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.730
Oh? Is that you, Hisako?

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.370
Are you alone, now?

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.160
Of course! Don't be silly.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.020
Then, I need to talk to you a little...

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.480
Listen, I have a deadline today.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.430
I'll call you back later.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.630
But, Mariko...

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.630
"Mariko" ...she said?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:11.960
Misonoo-san?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:18.050
We need to prepare tea for ten. Can you lend a hand?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.840
But... today isn't scheduled as a Sorority...

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.520
It's an unscheduled meeting.

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.540
This is only for senior Sorority members.

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:27.950
This concerns the case of Shinobu Mariko-san.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.960
She has brought disgrace upon the Sorority.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.910
We need to consider an appropriate punishment.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.250
Punishment?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.330
Yes, Miya-sama is deeply concerned as well.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:42.600
I am really sorry, I have a commitment.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.480
Please ask another member for help.

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:49.510
Let's go, Tomoko! <i> </i>

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:50.720
Let's go, Tomoko! OK!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:08.330
She's been suspended until the board meeting.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.580
How do you think she'll be punished?

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.530
The rumors say 2 or 3 months suspension...

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.480
She's the daughter of a celebrity who gave the school an endowment.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.760
So the school will want to be careful...

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:21.310
Oh, don't give me that nonsense!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:26.670
Just hold the meeting and expel her now!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.210
Won't you all be quiet? My wound is hurting.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.950
Oh...! Sorry!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.000
Does it hurt really bad?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.900
Yes, of course.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.550
Hello? Sorry to bother you.

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:08.800
But I've been waiting for you to call back all this time.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:12.080
I don't want to disturb your work but,

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:15.370
...but something awful happened concerning Mariko...

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.980
Hello?

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:23.260
I'm terribly sorry... your husband just left.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.040
I'm very sorry.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:35.540
I'm sorry...

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.180
...Mariko!?

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:50.180
Mariko! It must be Mariko...!

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.120
It's you...

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:01.340
Hisako! What happened... to Mariko?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.710
Dear! Dear!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:17.490
I don't know what I'd do if my parents...

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:23.410
Unlike yours, mine aren't really that close, you know.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.220
Let's go to the harbor.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.160
OK.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:35.580
<i>My dear Brother...</i>

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.540
<i>Right now, I'm wondering,</i>

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:41.290
<i>...how is she feeling, alone and crying somewhere...</i>

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:46.710
<i>Mariko-san, who is helpless to do anything about all this.</i>

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:52.000
<i>Loving both her parents, she doesn't know what to do.</i>

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.610
<i>My dear Brother...</i>

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:00.500
<i>...just because it is a matter of love between adults,</i>

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.380
<i>...we mustn't get involved?</i>

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:13.660
2 hotdogs and 2 cups of soup, please...

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:15.840
Thank you!

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.700
Here, have some. You must be hungry.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.740
I don't eat stuff like that.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.420
OK, I'll eat both.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.620
Mmm! Not bad. It's good!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:34.500
It's not the best, but it's warm, and good enough for now...

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.930
Don't talk with your mouth full, barbarian.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.530
Oooo... this mustard is hot!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.260
What? Did you say something?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.460
Never mind!

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:46.010
Hey, I'm not asking you,

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.750
...I'm asking your stomach!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.470
That's good. Your stomach is honest.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.810
Here you are.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:03.060
So, where to now?

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.810
We zoomed around the freeway like crazy,

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.090
...and climbed up the observatory at the harbor,

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:11.300
...so we could go to Chinatown, or the gaijin cemeteries...

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.050
Just say where, and we'll go there.

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:22.240
Yes. She finally calmed down a bit.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:26.560
That's right, she wanted to drive, so we drove around.

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:31.960
Yes, we went pretty far, but now we're back at the harbor.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.260
We had a light snack, and now she's dozing.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:41.250
She insisted I not call anyone, so I sneaked out when she nodded off.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:44.090
Yes, that's right.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.360
By the way, was the girl badly injured?

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:51.880
She's worried about that, and starts panicking when she thinks of it...

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:56.590
OK. I'll watch her a bit more, then bring her home.

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.670
So, tell her family not to worry.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:03.520
Oh good, both of you can relax...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.530
Ichinomiya-san is with her.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.160
What's the matter, Nanako?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:14.460
I'm so relieved - and exhausted.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:23.240
I am too... I'm... I'm very relieved. Thank you very much, both of you.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.300
Dear...

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:35.300
It's OK, it's lit. But, thank you...

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.230
<i>That night,</i>

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:44.250
<i>...Mariko-san returned shortly after 8 o'clock.</i>

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.170
Mariko!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.960
Mariko-san!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.170
Welcome home!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.350
Mariko!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.770
I'll be leaving...

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.980
Thank you for all you've done.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.680
Thank you so much.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.490
I can stay here with you tonight.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:11.450
I'd like to, too!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:16.530
Thank you! Please, I'd like that... Please.

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:20.420
OK. Let's play a card game before we go to bed.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:24.780
But, first I have something to do...

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:26.550
What's that?

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.770
Mariko...

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.120
Everything's OK. Try not to worry.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.970
We went to visit Misaki-san at her home.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:42.330
She wasn't seriously hurt... it's nothing serious.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:46.330
Why are you here?

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.960
After abandoning my mother and I... Why are you here?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.080
Mariko!

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:55.080
It's none of your business anymore what I do.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.900
Whether I attack my classmates, or kill somebody...

00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:01.320
Don't try to be nice and pretend to be my father.

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:02.830
Mariko!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.980
Go back to that woman..!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.010
Mariko!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.790
Why don't you scold me!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.530
Why do you keep forgiving him?

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:16.150
Everybody is lying! This house is filled with lies!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.830
The fact I was born is a lie.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.450
My own existence right now, is a lie!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:26.130
I should just disappear! I want to disappear!

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.480
I... I HATE MYSELF!!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:44.720
Nanako, come on, let's go.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.310
No... <i></i>

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.510
No... What?

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:49.190
I can't leave Mariko-san alone.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.170
Nanako!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.880
Mariko-san!

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:13.650
What is... what are you doing?

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.570
Aren't they pretty? I've been collecting them since I was little.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:22.950
On birthdays or Christmas, I would fill the house with candles.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.960
I wanted to spend time with my family and my holiday candles.

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:30.710
But... Papa was never here to share them.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.920
Over and over, never able to be with us...

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.880
But... today... he's finally here. So...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.000
What's today? What special day is today?

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.130
The last day.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:45.240
What? What?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.510
The LAST day!

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.010
No! Mariko-san!

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.630
Mariko-san!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.240
What are you...?!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.580
Let go!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:17:59.450
Don't!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.510
What... are you doing...?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:10.120
I'd rather see it burned down! The whole house!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.490
Go ahead, Mariko.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.110
Burn everything down if you want.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.650
Do whatever you want.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:25.650
But... but listen to what I'm saying.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:31.410
Whatever you do... and whatever happens... never hate yourself.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.430
Don't treat yourself like dirt.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.980
Without resorting to boasting or arrogance,

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.860
...you can find the good within you and love it always.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:47.500
No! I hate myself! I hate me!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:51.550
I'm selfish and irresponsible!

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.440
I hurt everyone around me, and no one cares about me!

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:08.870
It may seem to you that I'm a worthless man,

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:13.490
...and people who know me probably think I'm worthless,

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:17.380
...not taking care of my family, a job without prestige,

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.860
...and a life without any real direction.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:27.300
But I believe even I have some good inside of me.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:32.980
Maybe no one else notices it. I'm the only one that knows.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:39.180
It's something for me to nurture and love in secret.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.970
Do you know why?

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:45.100
Because you can't live without it.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:50.190
Or rather, if you have only that much and nothing else, you can live.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:57.540
If you can't love yourself, who will love you?

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:01.430
And if you don't love yourself, whom will you love?

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:07.060
Yes, you can. Because I love you in spite of everything, Papa!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.200
Mariko!

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:12.300
Forgive me, Mariko!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:13.910
Forgive me!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.310
<i>My dear Brother,</i>

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:38.080
<i>...what a wonderful Father, and loving Mother,</i>

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.420
<i>...and such an honest Mariko-san.</i>

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.810
<i>Each of them is such a great person.</i>

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:50.180
<i>Yet, in spite of that, their family is being destroyed.</i>

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:52.420
<i>Why is that, Brother?</i>

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.080
<i>How can that be?</i>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.160
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.640
<i>It's just too sad for me, and I can't understand.</i>

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.810
As you all know,

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:13.560
...yesterday a shameful incident disgraced our school.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:18.680
Last night we convened an emergency meeting of the senior members.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:24.550
At this time, I'd like to make an announcement to all the members.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:30.680
A decision was made unanimously by secret ballot,

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.430
...to expel Shinobu Mariko-san from the Sorority, effective yesterday.

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:41.840
Please state your objections now, if any...

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.390
That's not fair! That's too severe!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.080
<i>My dear Brother,</i>

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.290
<i>...I don't know what got into me.</i>

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:59.250
<i>Something inside forced me to jump up and start shouting.</i>

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.410
This is too one-sided!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:04.500
Why don't you listen to Shinobu-san's side of the story?

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:08.350
There must've been some reason for Shinobu-san to do what she did!

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:14.240
That's true. That's a reasonable point of view.

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:18.330
Continue, Misonoo-san. State your opinion.

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.540
But the decision is already made and it is absolute.

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:25.830
Please understand this, and then state your opinion.

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:35.120
As I said, the decision was based on the shameful facts.

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:37.400
The cause of her actions is irrelevant.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:42.050
Please go ahead.

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:46.540
"Decision"? "Absolute"?

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:49.080
What kind of Sorority is this?

00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:51.960
We are all students in the same school.

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:54.120
An "absolute decision"?

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:58.410
Decisions can't be forced on one student by another like this!

00:22:58.550 --> 00:23:00.820
What authority justifies such a thing?

00:23:02.930 --> 00:23:03.940
Watch what you say!

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.890
Do you know what you're talking about?

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:08.430
Quiet, please.

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:11.970
Everyone has a right to state her opinion.

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:16.160
Go on. Continue.

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:19.190
Then, I will leave the Sorority too!

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:20.930
Right here and now!

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:27.150
That... that is MY "decision"!

00:23:43.600 --> 00:23:49.090
<i>My dear Brother, I... I left the Sorority...!</i>

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:02.420 --> 00:25:04.630
Preview

00:25:04.770 --> 00:25:06.780
<i>After Mariko's incident,</i>

00:25:06.780 --> 00:25:10.260
<i>...Kaoru becomes convinced that the Sorority must be abolished.</i>

00:25:10.530 --> 00:25:12.810
<i>When she confides to Saint-Juste her plan,</i>

00:25:12.810 --> 00:25:14.880
<i>...Saint-Juste is shaken.</i>

00:25:16.010 --> 00:25:17.820
<i>Each follow their own feelings.</i>

00:25:17.820 --> 00:25:20.300
<i>The fated day of reckoning draws near.</i>

00:25:20.590 --> 00:25:21.400
<i>Next episode:</i> <i></i>

00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:23.070
<i>Next episode:</i> <b>The Student Assembly</b>

00:25:23.200 --> 00:25:24.750
<i>Brother, Dear Brother...</i> <i></i>

00:25:24.750 --> 00:25:27.430
<i>Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...</i>
